From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amphoze <184834775+Amphoze@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] guard: the gateway's assertion, verified

The gateway signs, for every request, who asks, for which project and in which role. This
is the verifier: the size and the envelope strictly, the Ed25519 signature with the node's
public key, the payload's bytes against their own re-serialisation, the members' types and
domains, the times, the node. One encoding is accepted, the one the gateway's signer
writes, and both sides run the same vectors. Every refusal is the same 401. The node's id
and the key file are read at the first use, never when the module loads.
---
